  "contentHtml": "<p>총 7-8차시로 진행되는 기후위기 ucc 촬영 수업입니다.</p><p>아이들이 직접 영상 제작하는 활동이라 반응이 가장 좋았던 수업이었습니다.</p><p>2학기에 기후위기 공모전 제출을 원하는 조는 제출시키려고 합니다!</p><p>(대신 조장이 영상을 잘 보관해놓고 공모전 기간내에 알아서 제출하라고 안내했습니다.)</p><p>올해 공모전은 아직 나오지 않아서 작년 자료로 가져왔습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76230d3646aaa2b67e0f39bae13b151767216bad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76230d3646aaa2b67e0f39bae13b151767216bad\" data-origin-width=\"1123\" data-origin-height=\"1587\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/faa84f35344fbd88e395f327ca29b5f134a80143?download\" data-file-name=\"기후위기.pptx\" data-file-size=\"2942160\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftpptx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D351%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20240802105435&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffaa84f35344fbd88e395f327ca29b5f134a80143')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기후위기</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.81MB</div></div></a></div><p>1차시) 무한도전 나비효과 시청</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nNV-nooRRbY\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">[12月의 무도] 에너지 과소비를 멈춰주세요..! &quot;나비효과&quot; infinite challenge (youtube.com)</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nNV-nooRRbY\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/boorYc/hyWG21ElGu/OiEwfNp0gkjVskTtVSm83k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=126_136_1058_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nNV-nooRRbY\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>2차시) 유퀴즈 기후위기 영상 시청 및 학습지 작성</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gRuHOK99lSk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gRuHOK99lSk</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gRuHOK99lSk\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/nDamb/hyWKzwIs0T/00fb7zfSXcHAj4MdEyh3A1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=200_80_1154_406\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gRuHOK99lSk\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e059acc03850ea35e3a8186582d555f324e05709?download\" data-file-name=\"기후위기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"194048\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D351%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20240802105435&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe059acc03850ea35e3a8186582d555f324e05709')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기후위기</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">189.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/15f3a2806acf728ee98817649bfc497113c4ec74?download\" data-file-name=\"기후위기_교사용.hwp\" data-file-size=\"129024\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D351%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20240802105435&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F15f3a2806acf728ee98817649bfc497113c4ec74')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기후위기_교사용</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">126.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>3차시) 작년 공모전 작품 시청 및 콘티 작성</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bNruIfUsgNI&amp;list=PLsv4SImhk3ReQYkA7JzaPgmdDIYWhnVxC&amp;index=15\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bNruIfUsgNI&amp;list=PLsv4SImhk3ReQYkA7JzaPgmdDIYWhnVxC&amp;index=15</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bNruIfUsgNI\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"852\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bOIZt9/hyWKCNJOBB/oqg0tqUTO0nf2lAs7YDT11/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=816_282_1146_440\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"852\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bNruIfUsgNI\" width=\"852\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>4-7차시) 영상 촬영 및 편집</p><p>-영상은 교실, 과학실, 운동장을 제외한 학교 야외 공간을 이용하였습니다.</p><p>-미리 전체 쪽지로 영상 제작을 위해 학생들이 돌아다닐 수 있다는 점을 양해를 부탁드렸습니다.</p><p>-영상 제작이 빠르게 끝난 조는 숨은 그림 찾기 o,x 퀴즈 진행</p><p>-수업시간 내에 완성을 못한 조는 발표날 전까지 완성하여 제출 안내</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68b485cc9a321f14b12f6d8bc6711871d25d9bf5?download\" data-file-name=\"기후위기_퍼즐.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"146403\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D351%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20240802105435&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F68b485cc9a321f14b12f6d8bc6711871d25d9bf5')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기후위기_퍼즐</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">142.97KB</div></div></a></div><p>8차시) 기후위기 ucc 발표</p><p>-자기 평가, 동료 평가서 작성</p><p>-가장 잘한 조 평가</p><p>&#160;</p><p>가장 반응이 좋았던 영상 하나 공유합니다!</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/cbdTzXoU4MU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/cbdTzXoU4MU</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cbdTzXoU4MU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"852\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bP9WBJ/hyWG3sIsew/7eDAnRRmgFq3K3uKrUou60/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=874_298_1108_552\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"852\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cbdTzXoU4MU\" width=\"852\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>평소 수업 참여도가 낮았던 학생들인데 멋진 작품을 만들어서 많은 칭찬을 해주었습니다.</p><p>물론 영상 퀄리티가 좋지 않았던 조들도 많았고, 조별 활동을 어려워하는 학생들도 있었지만 대부분의 학생들이 직접 영상을 찍고 편집하면서 재미를 느끼고 친구들이 만든 영상을 보니 반응이 굉장히 좋았습니다! ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
